    &lt;div class=&#34;hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0&#34;&gt;Originally published on &lt;a href=&#34;https://lnkd.in/p/ga-Z3iAC&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
