&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For RAG and AI applications in general, vector embeddings need to stay synchronized as the underlying data changes. When they don&amp;rsquo;t, search relevance and the user experience degrade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I walk through ways to handle these, including Integrated Embeddings in Azure Cosmos DB 👇&lt;/p&gt;
